5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know about all-in rates against meals bought separately and what separately booked rooms cost last time!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the pricing of offshore houses let whole and the all-in rates against meals bought separately.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think I'll check on time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I will check ferry sailings and train time, as well as getting around by train and bus.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look into bathing hours and bathroom provision, and inn mealtimes and room arrangements.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Does anyone else think we should check the valley inn rates versus urban beds? I'm curious if it's a big difference!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I think that's a good idea, but I've already picked my two. Maybe someone else can take it?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I can take that one! I'll swap ""how last year's days ran"" for the valley inn rates versus urban beds.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
