15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Midori, thanks for swapping! I'm excited to hear what you find out about the prices.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I'm glad we're being thorough. It's better to have all the facts before we make a final decision.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,Of course! I just want to make sure we find a place where everyone feels comfortable and happy.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Having a clear picture of the logistics will help us avoid any unnecessary stress during the trip.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. I just want to make sure we have a place where we can all relax.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm all set with my choices! I can't wait to see what we discover so we can pick the best spot!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I am also satisfied with our list. Let's proceed and see what the research reveals.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm ready too. I hope the information helps us find the perfect balance for everyone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
