60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I still think the city sounds the most exciting, but if we want to be fair with money, maybe the island or the spa town is better!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that predictability is key, and the spa town's all-in rate is very appealing for budgeting purposes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm leaning toward the spa town too, as it seems to offer a nice balance of group time and accessibility.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The city is the most efficient, but the spa town's ninety-minute train ride is far superior to spending two full days on ferries.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm still worried about the shared room at the inn, but the city is so expensive and the island's bathroom sounds stressful. Maybe the spa town is the best compromise.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"If everyone is leaning toward the spa town, I'm okay with that too! As long as we all have a great time together!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"I feel much more comfortable with the spa town's pricing structure, as it prevents the final bill from becoming a surprise.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I think the spa town will allow us to be together without the feeling of being trapped, since we can still explore the town.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"I'm satisfied with the spa town; the travel time is minimal, which means we maximize our actual holiday time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll try my best to handle the shared room if it means we can all be together and the travel is easy.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm happy as long as we're all together! I vote for the Hot Spring Town!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The predictability of the cost is the most important factor for me. I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,I agree that it's the best balance for our group. I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I value the efficiency of the travel time above all else. I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go with the group. I vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! It's decided then! I can't wait to go to the Hot Spring Town with everyone!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I am glad we reached a consensus that satisfies everyone's needs. It will be a very relaxing trip.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm looking forward to it too. It'll be wonderful to relax and enjoy each other's company in such a peaceful setting.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I will start looking into the specific train schedules so we can make the most of our time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'm glad we all agreed. I'll look forward to the hot springs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
